cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this application, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Spectral DEMATEL: a browser-based diagnosis of DEMATEL influence matrices"
abstract: >-
  A Shiny application that diagnoses a DEMATEL influence matrix: the structural
  type of the system, whether the matrix is in scope, how influence enters and
  accumulates, which single relationship moves the system most, and how firmly
  any of that is held. It runs entirely in the browser on WebAssembly, so no
  matrix a user pastes ever leaves their machine. Every spectral quantity is
  computed by the spectralDEMATEL package.
type: software
authors:
